OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785428340
OL,3,CPhone of woman found dead in Athens
OL,4,Csuitcase used to mislead family after
OL,5,Cdeath
OL,7,FThe phone of a Scottish woman whose
OL,8,Fbody was found in a suitcase in Greece
OL,9,Fwas active for several days after her
OL,10,Fdeath in order to mislead those close
OL,11,Fto her, it has been reported.
OL,13,FElisabeth-Jane Ross, 38, is believed
OL,14,Fto have died between five and seven
OL,15,Fdays before she was found by a
OL,16,Fhomeless man in a derelict building in
OL,17,Fthe Kypseli area of Athens on July 18.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
