PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785428340
OL,3,CPhone of woman found dead in Athens
OL,4,Csuitcase used to mislead family after
OL,5,Cdeath
OL,7,FThe Guardian newspaper's Athens
OL,8,Fcorrespondent Helena Smith told the
OL,9,FBBC Ms Ross had been in Greece for
OL,10,Fabout two weeks before she died.
OL,12,FThe journalist said messages were then
OL,13,Fsent from Ms Ross's phone in an
OL,14,Fapparent attempt to confuse the search.
OL,16,F"She had been staying with a Greek
OL,17,Ffriend here in the capital, and then
OL,18,Fshe disappeared," Ms Smith said.
OL,26,@xD@AOUzD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
