PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785428340
OL,3,CPhone of woman found dead in Athens
OL,4,Csuitcase used to mislead family after
OL,5,Cdeath
OL,7,F"It would seem that someone had
OL,8,Fcontrol, and I use that word very
OL,9,Fdeliberately, over her mobile phone
OL,10,Fafter she died, and was sending
OL,11,Fmessages clearly to distract from the
OL,12,Fscent, to distract the authorities and
OL,13,Fher close friends from trying to track
OL,14,Fher down."
OL,16,FGreek police authorities identified
OL,17,Fher after Interpol examined
OL,18,Ffingerprint data.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@JO]
