OL,3,CPhone of woman found dead in Athens
OL,4,Csuitcase used to mislead family after
OL,5,Cdeath
OL,7,FA spokesperson for Greek police said:
OL,8,F"Further details have been requested
OL,9,Fregarding when she arrived in Greece,
OL,10,Fhow, and with whom.
OL,12,F"We cannot provide further details at
OL,13,Fthis stage, as the investigation is
OL,14,Ffully underway."
