OL,3,CPhone of woman found dead in Athens
OL,4,Csuitcase used to mislead family after
OL,5,Cdeath
OL,7,FThe Foreign and Commonwealth Office
OL,8,Fsaid: "Our thoughts are with
OL,9,FElisabeth's family during this
OL,10,Fdifficult time. We are providing
OL,11,Fconsular support and are in contact
OL,12,Fwith the local authorities."
OL,14,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said:
OL,15,F"We are aware of the death of a
OL,16,FScottish woman in Athens and are
OL,17,Fliaising with authorities in Greece.
OL,19,F"Officers are providing support to her
OL,20,Ffamily in Scotland."
